@IGGWebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046

### Get all GPS devices
GET {{IGGWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/GPSDevice
Accept: application/json

### Get GPS device by ID
GET {{IGGWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/GPSDevice/1
Accept: application/json

### Create GPS device
POST {{IGGWebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/GPSDevice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "GPS001",
  "vehicleId": 101
}

###